ed_weights/TripoSG`\n = TripoSG-scribble (scribble+prompt condition) model from [VAST-AI/TripoSG-scribble](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSG-scribble) → `pretrained_weights/TripoSG-scribble`"}]}